summary:
  A dead MPRIS bridge is never noticed, so the media keys stay dead.

history:
  Measured on 2026-09-22: the daemon was killed while the radio played, the
  music carried on for minutes and the bus name never came back, so the
  media keys, the lock screen and the speaker's own buttons were quietly
  dead until the next playback start. The state write asks after it now.

target:
  package/contents/ui/main.qml

find:
                  if ((stdout || "").indexOf("__MPRIS_GONE__") !== -1 && _mprisStarted

replace:
                  if (false && _mprisStarted

expect:
  Killed by test_invariants::test_the_mpris_bridge_is_watched_while_the_widget_wants_one.
  Line-neutral.
